{"_nota":"Destravando B2 · ouvido (fala grudada + palavras parecidas). Não repete A2 nem B1.","grudada":[{"title":"Musta, mighta, couldn'ta (dedução no passado)","items":[{"tts":"He musta forgotten.","options":["He must have forgotten.","He must forget.","He's mostly forgotten."],"answer":0,"pt":"Ele deve ter esquecido.","tip":"musta = must have","file":"ouvido-gr0_0-ee6bd19e.mp3"},{"tts":"She mighta missed the bus.","options":["She might have missed the bus.","She might miss the bus.","She may miss the bus."],"answer":0,"pt":"Ela pode ter perdido o ônibus.","tip":"mighta = might have","file":"ouvido-gr0_1-5a30df25.mp3"},{"tts":"They couldn'ta known.","options":["They couldn't have known.","They couldn't know.","They could have known."],"answer":0,"pt":"Eles não tinham como saber.","tip":"couldn'ta = couldn't have","file":"ouvido-gr0_2-8f3af617.mp3"},{"tts":"It musta been Tony.","options":["It must have been Tony.","It must be Tony.","It must've be Tony."],"answer":0,"pt":"Deve ter sido o Tony.","tip":"musta been = must have been","file":"ouvido-gr0_3-7976bac2.mp3"},{"tts":"You mighta left it at work.","options":["You might have left it at work.","You might leave it at work.","You may have left it at work."],"answer":0,"pt":"Você pode ter deixado no trabalho.","tip":"mighta = might have","file":"ouvido-gr0_4-b2c3866b.mp3"},{"tts":"He can'ta seen it.","options":["He can't have seen it.","He can't see it.","He can have seen it."],"answer":0,"pt":"Não tem como ele ter visto.","tip":"can'ta = can't have","file":"ouvido-gr0_5-d81d761e.mp3"}]},{"title":"Shouldn'ta, woulda been (arrependimento e cobrança)","items":[{"tts":"You shouldn'ta told him.","options":["You shouldn't have told him.","You shouldn't tell him.","You should have told him."],"answer":0,"pt":"Você não devia ter contado pra ele.","tip":"shouldn'ta = shouldn't have","file":"ouvido-gr1_0-205bf5c8.mp3"},{"tts":"It woulda been great.","options":["It would have been great.","It would be great.","It was great."]